---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Engineering the Intelligence of Tomorrow" description="AxeroAI engineers high-performance AI products and innovation systems for next-generation digital infrastructure.">
	<main class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-8">
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="min-h-[80vh] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center pt-32 pb-20 gap-16">
			<div class="flex-1 space-y-10">
				<div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 border border-black/10 rounded-full">
					<span class="label-caps !text-black !tracking-widest">Pioneering the Digital Frontier</span>
				</div>
				<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-8xl font-black text-black leading-[1.05] font-sans tracking-tighter">
					Engineering <br/> <span class="text-gray-400">Intelligence.</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-600 max-w-xl font-sans font-light leading-relaxed">
					AxeroAI builds high-performance AI products and innovation systems for the next generation of digital infrastructure.
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-4 pt-6">
					<button class="bg-black text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-gray-800 transition-all active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 group">
						Explore Ventures
						<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
					</button>
					<button class="border border-black/10 text-black px-10 py-5 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-black/5 transition-all flex items-center justify-center">
						Get in Touch
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="flex-1 w-full relative">
				<div class="aspect-[4/5] bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden relative group border border-black/5 shadow-2xl">
					<img 
						alt="Precision Engineering Visualization" 
						class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale opacity-90 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-1000" 
						src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1635070041078-e363dbe005cb?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop"
						referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
					/>
					<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-white/20 to-transparent"></div>
				</div>
				<!-- Minimal Decorative Elements -->
				<div class="absolute -top-6 -right-6 w-32 h-32 border-t border-r border-black/10 rounded-tr-[40px]"></div>
				<div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 w-32 h-32 border-b border-l border-black/10 rounded-bl-[40px]"></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Trust & Philosophy -->
		<section class="py-24 border-y border-black/5">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
				<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-black leading-tight tracking-tight">
					Beyond theory. <br/> <span class="text-gray-300">We build reality.</span>
				</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed">
					Most AI firms focus on promises. We focus on production. Our systems are engineered for reliability, safety, and measurable impact in high-stakes environments.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Capabilities (Clean Bento) -->
		<section class="py-32">
			<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end mb-20 gap-6">
				<div class="space-y-4">
					<span class="label-caps !text-black">CAPABILITIES</span>
					<h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-black tracking-tighter">Core Verticals</h3>
				</div>
				<div class="w-full md:w-1/3 h-px bg-black/10"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
				<div class="group p-10 border border-black/5 rounded-3xl hover:border-black/20 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col h-[400px]">
					<div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gray-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:bg-black group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
						<span class="material-symbols-outlined">neurology</span>
					</div>
					<h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black mb-4">Neural Architecture</h4>
					<p class="text-gray-500 font-light flex-grow leading-relaxed">Designing custom model architectures optimized for specific industrial logic and decision kernels.</p>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-black font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mt-6 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
						Learn More <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">north_east</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="group p-10 border border-black/5 rounded-3xl hover:border-black/20 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col h-[400px] bg-gray-50">
					<div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:bg-black group-hover:text-white transition-colors shadow-sm">
						<span class="material-symbols-outlined">settings_input_component</span>
					</div>
					<h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black mb-4">Autonomous Systems</h4>
					<p class="text-gray-500 font-light flex-grow leading-relaxed">Agentic workflows that operate with precision across decentralized digital and physical assets.</p>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-black font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mt-6 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
						Learn More <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">north_east</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="group p-10 border border-black/5 rounded-3xl hover:border-black/20 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col h-[400px]">
					<div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gray-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:bg-black group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
						<span class="material-symbols-outlined">language</span>
					</div>
					<h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black mb-4">Interface Layer</h4>
					<p class="text-gray-500 font-light flex-grow leading-relaxed">Zero-friction human-AI collaboration platforms built for high-throughput enterprise use.</p>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-black font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mt-6 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
						Learn More <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">north_east</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Product Showcase -->
		<section class="py-32 bg-black -mx-6 md:-mx-8 px-6 md:px-8 text-white rounded-[40px] md:rounded-[80px] overflow-hidden">
			<div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto">
				<div class="space-y-6 mb-20">
					<span class="label-caps !text-gray-500">PORTFOLIO</span>
					<h3 class="text-4xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tighter">Current Releases</h3>
				</div>
				
				<div class="space-y-32">
					<!-- Release 1 -->
					<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16 items-center">
						<div class="flex-1 w-full aspect-video rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-white/5 border border-white/10 group">
							<img 
								src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?q=80&w=2064&auto=format&fit=crop" 
								alt="Lumina Core" 
								class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700"
								referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
							/>
						</div>
						<div class="flex-1 space-y-8">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
								<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] border border-white/20 px-3 py-1 rounded">V1.2 Stable</span>
								<div class="w-12 h-px bg-white/20"></div>
							</div>
							<h4 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black">Lumina Core</h4>
							<p class="text-gray-400 font-light text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
								A unified neural engine for enterprise-wide knowledge synthesis and predictive modeling.
							</p>
							<button class="flex items-center gap-4 group text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
								Explore System <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-black transition-all">
									<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">north_east</span>
								</span>
							</button>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Release 2 -->
					<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse gap-16 items-center">
						<div class="flex-1 w-full aspect-video rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-white/5 border border-white/10 group">
							<img 
								src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633167606207-d840b5070fc2?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop" 
								alt="Aether Orchestrator" 
								class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700"
								referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
							/>
						</div>
						<div class="flex-1 space-y-8">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
								<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] border border-white/20 px-3 py-1 rounded">Beta Access</span>
								<div class="w-12 h-px bg-white/20"></div>
							</div>
							<h4 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black">Aether</h4>
							<p class="text-gray-400 font-light text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
								Multi-agent orchestration platform for large-scale automation in high-consequence industries.
							</p>
							<button class="flex items-center gap-4 group text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
								Explore System <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-black transition-all">
									<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">north_east</span>
								</span>
							</button>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Methodology -->
		<section class="py-32">
			<div class="text-center space-y-4 mb-24">
				<span class="label-caps !text-black">METHODOLOGY</span>
				<h3 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tighter">The Engineering Loop</h3>
			</div>
			
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 text-center">
				<div class="space-y-6 px-4">
					<div class="text-7xl font-black text-gray-100 mb-[-30px]">01</div>
					<h5 class="text-xl font-bold">Ideation</h5>
					<p class="text-gray-500 font-light text-sm">Rigorous identification of structural inefficiencies and AI-driven potential.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="space-y-6 px-4">
					<div class="text-7xl font-black text-gray-100 mb-[-30px]">02</div>
					<h5 class="text-xl font-bold">Inception</h5>
					<p class="text-gray-500 font-light text-sm">Rapid architectural modeling and safety benchmark establishment.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="space-y-6 px-4">
					<div class="text-7xl font-black text-gray-100 mb-[-30px]">03</div>
					<h5 class="text-xl font-bold">Iteration</h5>
					<p class="text-gray-500 font-light text-sm">Continuous feedback loops to refine model precision and edge-case resilience.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="space-y-6 px-4">
					<div class="text-7xl font-black text-gray-100 mb-[-30px]">04</div>
					<h5 class="text-xl font-bold">Integration</h5>
					<p class="text-gray-500 font-light text-sm">Seamless deployment into existing enterprise infrastructure stacks.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Final CTA -->
		<section class="py-40 text-center">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
				<h2 class="text-5xl md:text-8xl font-black text-black leading-none tracking-tighter">
					Ready for the <br/> <span class="text-gray-300">future of work?</span>
				</h2>
				<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-6">
					<button class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-black text-white px-12 py-6 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-gray-800 transition-all text-lg">
						Start Building
					</button>
					<button class="w-full sm:w-auto border border-black/10 text-black px-12 py-6 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-black/5 transition-all text-lg">
						Inquiry Form
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</MainLayout>
